/**
 * Deliberate breaks used by scripts/mutation-check.mjs (`npm run test:mutations`).
 *
 * Each entry: { id, description, file, find, replace, tests } or, for behaviour guarded in several places,
 * { id, description, file, edits: [{ find, replace }, ...], tests }. Every `find` must occur exactly once in `file`; `tests` are the test files expected to FAIL once the break is applied.
 * Write breaks that model a realistic regression (a dropped header, an off-by-one, a removed UI element), not
 * syntax errors: a syntax error proves nothing about the assertions.
 */

